  "goodToKnow": "Die Generalprobe is the dress rehearsal, the last full run-through before the Premiere (opening night). Theatre superstition says a bad dress rehearsal means a good premiere. Figuratively, a final test before a big event: Das Testspiel war die Generalprobe für das Turnier. Die Probe means rehearsal, sample or test. Plural: die Generalproben."
